{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And if you walk with Me keri.</b> Since these plagues are plagues that make one feel and recognize the providence — that HaShem is disciplining them — and when they do not return in repentance, there is no response other than to say: this is keri." "<b>Seven for your sins.</b> Even though they did not transgress with new sins, nevertheless, since they did not return after the chastisements, it is accounted to them as though they are sinning anew."], :book :leviticus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:02:15.117142806Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}